  "honest_grade": "The current Mac instance is a certification-ready research operations system, not yet a certified production observatory service and not an autonomous discovery/publication machine. It can receive rights-cleared public alerts, preserve provenance, assemble public follow-up evidence, compute gated local analyses, and help a human decide what needs review. It cannot make telescope access, data rights, scientific validation, or authorship appear where none exists. The live /api/v1/certification report is the authority for the three independent certificate states.",
